{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12421","headline":"送马员外拜官觐省 · 钱起","name":"送马员外拜官觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十爲郎事汉文，鸳雏骥子自爲羣。\n笔精已许台中妙，劒术还令世上闻。\n归觐屡经槐里月，出师常笑棘门军。\n莫言来往朝天远，看取鸣鞘入断云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}